 622:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/CMSIS/Include\core_cm0.h **** /** \brief  Get Interrupt Priority
 623:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/CMSIS/Include\core_cm0.h **** 
 624:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/CMSIS/Include\core_cm0.h ****     The function reads the priority of an interrupt. The interrupt
 625:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/CMSIS/Include\core_cm0.h ****     number can be positive to specify an external (device specific)
 626:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/CMSIS/Include\core_cm0.h ****     interrupt, or negative to specify an internal (core) interrupt.
 627:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/CMSIS/Include\core_cm0.h **** 
 628:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/CMSIS/Include\core_cm0.h **** 
