 630:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/CMSIS/Include\core_cm0.h ****     \return             Interrupt Priority. Value is aligned automatically to the implemented
 631:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/CMSIS/Include\core_cm0.h ****                         priority bits of the microcontroller.
 632:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/CMSIS/Include\core_cm0.h ****  */
