 650:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/CMSIS/Include\core_cm0.h ****                                                                   buffered write are completed befo
 651:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/CMSIS/Include\core_cm0.h ****   SCB->AIRCR  = ((0x5FA << SCB_AIRCR_VECTKEY_Pos)      |
