  68:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_gpio.h ****  * GPIO driver provide a generic and very flexible software interface for all standard digital I/O 
  69:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_gpio.h ****  * Each port slice has individual interfaces for the operation as General Purpose I/O and it furthe
  70:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_gpio.h ****  * connectivity to the on-chip periphery and the control for the pad characteristics. 
